        "effectiveDateTime": "2025-11-22",
        "valueString": "Limited English; attends with adult daughter who interprets. Patient relies on daughter for interpretation and tends to nod along, with concern she may not fully understand dosing and safety warnings. Declined telephone interpreter service today, saying daughter was okay."
